short_desc "A notebook"
long_desc "The notebook of the Bards, it has 30 pages."
name "notebook"
alias_name "bardnotebook"
alt_name 0
read_msg "This is the notebook of the Bards.Please return it to Taliesin if you find it.Possible commands are:write <line>read page [<page>]clear"
info "This object will be saved after writing it."
value 100
local_weight 1
page 2
gd 6
notes ({"Good Day Bards.Things have changed drastically./by the End of April, the new bard soul will be up.I know you'll all like it.To describe the changes:The instruments are no more.A lot of NEAT abilites are added:Beggar: Great to use when you are low on goldSongbird: A nice tell power...(suggested by Zavien)Strum Lute: Calms the clouded minds(reminds me no more brooch, your bard soul is now a lute)Detail: Updated and improvedLocate Taliesin: You asked for it...you get it. (suggested by ALL)Voice: Learn to throw your voice...amuse your friends...>Some deletions:changelook: currently absentInstruments: removedMake: removedRestore: removed>","A few more abilities:Pretitle: As good as everTitle: hehe you know it you love itMaybe: Direct Exos line :)Bard: You'll love the new bard lineSing: Still being reworked.Songs: Need NEW songs!>In place of instruments, there are now bard spellsCheck them out:Utter Chaos: Confuses EVERYONE in room (Legend ability)Confusion: Causes monsters to do funky thingsEnchant Weapon: Boost your weapon's performanceIrresistable Dance: A monster can't defend well while dancing...Lullaby: Sometimes its best to put your foe to bed...Pyrotechnics: A little sizzle pop boom...Silence: Help prevent your foe from casting spellsQuiet: Prevents EVERYONE in room from casting (Legend Ability)Seduction: Nothing better than some seductionStarshine: Brightens up the room you are in permanentlyUncontrollable Laughter: Hard to hit someone while laughing....Armour of Ithan: Nice armour...",0,0,"Some new idea:                                                                                1., The drum and violin do a very little damage.     a., Increase the damage.     b., Some new instruments:          -tambourine    (drum for high level bards)          -cello         (violin for high level bards)                                                                                In case of b., a little change is need for the drum.To use it you need a lot of sp. That's not fair...                                                                                2., Ventriloquism:     This is your idea, Exos!     Do you work on it?                                                                                3., Bard-legends:     Well... you know it...                                                                                4., Illusions:     Well, well... Great theme for bards, isn't it?     There was a spell /named illusion/ for the mages.     I think that was very cool.     Or some little tricks:     Example a flower or an animal, etc.                                                                                5., The brooch:     I think it would be better, if the brooch showed you,     how many charges it contains. (But maybe not...)                                                                                6., The harp:     I can make a harp. That's good.     I can use it. That's very good.     But why can't I play a sad melody?                                                                                7., New play command:     -play <instrument> attribute      -other people's message: Bard is playing on <inst.> attr.     -play magic <inst.>      -You will use the magic of the instrument. /Like now/.     -rplay <inst.> <person> attr.      -You will play to one person on your instrument.                                                                                8., Pretitle, and shout:     Pretitle should be shown at shouting.","Ballot:                                                                                You can vote for my ideas.Just type simple 'yes' or 'no' below the number of the idea./Hint on page 2.//Please, give your name too.//I just wnat to know, if all the bards voted./Thanks:                        Loncarm                                                                                 1     2     3     4     5     6     7     8     Your nameyes   yes   yes   yes   yes   yes   yes   yes    Falcon Loryn","                                                                                            Winter best wishes                                                                                Winter, this wonderful season of sweet,Which is the mother of all joy and peace,And the beautiful pearl of winter,Feast of merry Christmas,Keeps You in full of best,In snow is up to Your knees, and falling into Your neck!                                                                                Merry Christmas, and a Happy New Year to all of You!                                                                                                                        Loncarm Dak Regis","Hellllllllo bards.Yes, I am OFFICIALLY the guild master of bards now.so here's an overview:whole guild system is being revamped.so the new bards will be one of the first under the new system.let my cover some of my ideas:#1 - Find Taliesin, good power, rather self-explanatory.#2 - Ventriloquism (It was recently ruled illegal when Blade     took the idea and put it into thief.  So I will have to make     it less abusable)#3 - Legend Levels (Yes you want em, you got em :)#4 - Utter Chaos (Effects all non-bards in room.  Random effects     ranging from cease fighting, walk away, paralyzation, or worse.     changes randomly each round.)#5 - Uncontrollable Laughter (effects one target.  Hard to fight     when you are laughing.  Sometimes they laugh so hard as to cause     internal damage :)#6 - Irresistable Dance (effects one target.  Dancing forces their AC     down, and also causes a temporary loss of strength and     constitution.  And some people have two left feet [like me :)]     so they stumble and hurt themselves once in a while :)#7 - Revamping the instruments.#8 - Waiting for YOUR suggestions.  POST them in the notebook, just     as friend Loncarm has told you on page 2Your loving Guildmaster,Exos",0,0,0,0,"vanessa loves loncarm","AND WHO LOVES LORYN ?????",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,"loncarm loves vanessa",0,0,0,0,0,0,"notebook",})
